ipelines to automate routine business workflows.","conclusion":"Saved hundreds of operational hours per month by bridging CRM, billing, messaging, and database updates seamlessly.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"n8n workflow hub orchestration preview"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"n8n automation canvas diagram showing multi-step API connectors"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"n8n visual node workflow execution graph"},"images":[{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"n8n trigger and webhook integration nodes"},{"src":"/images/n8n/automation.png","alt":"Self-hosted n8n workflow execution logs"},{"src":"/images/n8n/automation .png","alt":"AI agent routing node and LLM integration in n8n"}],"services":["n8n Architecture","API & Webhook Integrations","Data Transformation","Workflow Optimization"],"client":"Internal & Client Systems","website":"","tags":["n8n","Automation","Webhooks","REST APIs","Pipelines"],"serviceSlugs":["n8n-automation"],"link":"","quote":"Turned complex multi-tool operational headaches into reliable, zero-touch background automation.","quoteAuthor":"Automation Engineering","quoteRole":"Integration Systems","credits":[{"role":"Automation Architect","name":"Outman El Bouhali"}]},"nextProject":{"slug":"docker-vps","title":"Docker VPS","category":"Cloud & Infrastructure","year":"2025","tagline":"VPS container orchestration & CI/CD deployment.","description":"Production VPS orchestration system leveraging Docker containers, NGINX reverse proxy, automated SSL certificates, and streamlined CI/CD flows.","overview":"Designed and deployed a resilient server infrastructure on a Linux VPS. Isolated services into lightweight Docker containers, configured multi-domain SSL with Let’s Encrypt, and orchestrated automated zero-downtime deployment pipelines with GitHub Actions.","conclusion":